OmniGraph is a modified and localized distribution derived from Graphify.
Significant changes from the original work:
  - Rebranded to OmniGraph.
  - Comments and documentation localized to Brazilian Portuguese.
  - Added a cross-platform installer and local-AI (Ollama) integration.
  - Dependency and security maintenance.

